      "Stale tabs heal themselves: when a deploy replaces the running build mid-session, the app used to throw 'An unexpected response was received from the server' and file it as a bug report. It now recognizes the three stale-build signatures and quietly reloads once instead — with a 30-second guard so a page that is genuinely broken (not merely stale) still files its report.",
